flowchart TD
    S([Start]) --> O[Open Mock Exam page]
    O --> T[Select exam type: KPP Combined or KPP Standard]
    T --> SE[Select exam set]
    SE --> I[/Display instructions/]
    I --> ST[Click Start Mock Exam and start timer]
    ST --> Q[/Display question/]
    Q --> SA[Select or change answer]
    SA --> F{Flag question?}
    F -->|Yes| MF[Mark question as flagged]
    MF --> TE{Time expired?}
    F -->|No| TE
    TE -->|Yes| AS[Submit exam automatically]
    AS --> CS[Calculate result]
    TE -->|No| N{Learner action?}
    N -->|Go to another question| Q
    N -->|Submit Exam| U{Unanswered questions?}
    U -->|Yes| CF{Submit anyway?}
    CF -->|No| Q
    CF -->|Yes| CS
    U -->|No| CS
    CS --> SV[Save attempt to database]
    SV --> RS[/Display pass or fail result/]
    RS --> RA{Result action?}
    RA -->|Review Answers| RV[/Display answer review/]
    RV --> E([End])
    RA -->|Try Again| I
    RA -->|Back to Progress| E
